OL,3,GNEWSAFree service coming to help people
OL,4,A'have their voice heard'               
OL,6,FA free, independent advocacy service is
OL,7,Fto be set up on the Isle of Man to help
OL,8,Fpeople "have their voice heard" when   
OL,9,Fusing health and social care services. 
OL,11,FThe Department of Health and Social    
OL,12,FCare (DHSC) has partnered with UK      
OL,13,Fcharity VoiceAbility to run the        
OL,14,Fservice, which is expected to launch in
OL,15,FApril.                                 
OL,17,FIt will support people being assessed  
OL,18,For treated under mental health law,    
OL,19,Fbefore expanding to other areas of     
OL,20,Fcare.                                  
