OL,3,GNEWSAFree service coming to help people
OL,4,A'have their voice heard'               
OL,6,F"Everyone should have the opportunity  
OL,7,Fto understand their rights, be involved
OL,8,Fin decisions affecting their lives, and
OL,9,Fhave their voice heard," said Donna    
OL,10,FBronson-Barnes, who is the Director of 
OL,11,FOperations at VoiceAbility.            
